WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.182
Impossible events cannot happen, certain events must happen, and possible events may

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:05.597
happen.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:12.137
Classify the event: rolling a zero on an ordinary six-sided die. The answer is

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:16.605
impossible. A standard die has faces 1–6; this outcome is impossible.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.720
A player at a science exhibition is rolling a zero on an ordinary six-sided die. How

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.685
likely is this event? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:32.406
A player at a science exhibition is rolling a zero on an ordinary six-sided die. How

00:00:32.406 --> 00:00:37.912
likely is this event? The answer is impossible. A standard die has faces 1–6; this

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.013
outcome is impossible.
